# Scenario 4 - Auto Registration

## Architecture

```text
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ Private DNS Zone            │
│ contoso.internal            │
└────────────┬────────────────┘
             │
             │ Auto Registration
             ▼
┌─────────────────────────────┐
│ VM01                        │
│ 10.1.1.10                   │
└─────────────────────────────┘

DNS Record Created:

vm01.contoso.internal
       ↓
    10.1.1.10
```

## Requirement

Whenever a new VM is deployed into the VNet, DNS records should be generated automatically.

## Question

Which feature should be enabled?

A. Conditional Forwarding

B. Alias Records

C. Auto Registration

D. Route Propagation

<details>
<summary>Answer</summary>

✅ **C**

Auto Registration automatically creates and maintains DNS records for Azure VMs.

</details>

