# Scenario 5 - Public DNS and CNAME Records

## Architecture

```text
Users
  │
  ▼
portal.contoso.com
  │
  ▼
CNAME Record
  │
  ▼
myapp.azurewebsites.net
  │
  ▼
Azure App Service
```

## Requirement

Administrators want users to access:

```text
portal.contoso.com
```

without tracking changing IP addresses.

## Question

Which DNS record should be configured?

A. A Record

B. MX Record

C. TXT Record

D. CNAME Record

<details>
<summary>Answer</summary>

✅ **D**

A CNAME creates an alias to another hostname and avoids managing changing IP addresses.

</details>

