```text
A Record      = Hostname → IP Address

CNAME         = Hostname → Hostname

MX            = Mail Routing

TXT           = Verification / SPF / Metadata

Private DNS   = Internal Azure Name Resolution

Public DNS    = Internet Name Resolution

Peering       = Connectivity

DNS Link      = Name Resolution

Private Endpoint
      +
Private DNS Zone
      =
Exam Question
